Description: Free peer-reviewed portable C++ source libraries (intel + openmpi5, OpenHPC)
 Boost provides free peer-reviewed portable C++ source libraries.
 Boost emphasizes libraries that work well with the C++ Standard Library.
 Built with the intel compiler family and openmpi5 MPI stack.
